    "title": "Off-duty St. Louis police officer hits scooter driver, leaving them in critical condition - NewsBreak",
    "text": "8 hours ago ST. LOUIS — An off-duty St. Louis police officer hit a motor scooter driver with their truck, leaving them in critical condition. The officer's Ford F-150 hit the man on Morgan Ford Road near the River Des Peres around midnight. The truck made a left turn onto Carondelet Boulevard as a Zhiwei scooter traveled northbound on Morgan Ford across Carondelet. They collided at the intersection. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 8",
